<title>USA: NY banks borrowed from Fed's window in April 30 wk.</title>
<headline>NY banks borrowed from Fed's window in April 30 wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fewer than half of the six major New York City banks borrowed from the Federal Reserve's discount window in the week ended April 30, a Fed spokeswoman said. No further details were available.</p>
<p>It was the middle of the two-week bank maintenance period.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
